{"id":"633551","name":"抹茶马拉糕","author":"どら","authorId":"10454906","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633551/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"木薯淀粉","amount":"150克"},{"name":"低粉","amount":"250克"},{"name":"菠菜汁","amount":"400克"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"60克"},{"name":"泡打粉","amount":"2克"},{"name":"植物油","amount":"20克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"5克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"菠菜汁加入5克酵母粉，60克白糖，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/633551/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入木薯淀粉，低粉搅拌均匀成面糊。","img":"images/633551/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"发酵中。","img":"images/633551/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"发酵40分钟。","img":"images/633551/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入泡打粉，植物油，从底部往上拌均匀。","img":"images/633551/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"八寸锅底模具，涮一层植物油。","img":"images/633551/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入模具中。","img":"images/633551/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"入蒸锅，大火蒸30分钟。","img":"images/633551/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品图。。","img":"images/633551/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}